# name: The internet, in layers
# blurb: A stack of layers with parts and a brace.
title "The internet, in layers"
layout stack
paper notebook
pen ballpoint
seed 5

- Application
  - HTTP
  - DNS
  - SMTP
- Transport
  - TCP
  - UDP
- Internet
- Link
brace application..transport "your code talks here"
note internet "IP addresses live here"
highlight tcp
